{"title":"Gaunt Ogre","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 33 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 25 times (2.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=33\" title=\"Pick level 33\"><td><b>33</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>137</td><td>22.7</td><td>1,650</td><td class=\"muted\">411 · 31.8 · 4,950</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=34\" title=\"Pick level 34\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia%20Iron%20Mine\">Binxonia Iron Mine</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 849 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 849 looted corpses, 883 recorded drops, 27,120 total, 10–171 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"e